OL,5,G0100 AJD
OL,6,     FAJD starts the weekend early with
OL,7,     Fa blend of big party tunes.
OL,8,     FStarting off with Arijit Singh and
OL,9,     FMartin Garrix, AJD spins Dystinct
OL,10,     Fand Shreya Ghoshal with BombayMami
OL,11,     Fand Troyboi.
OL,12,G0300 Asian Network Punjabi with AJD
OL,13,     FAJD explores the UK's influence on
OL,14,     Fthe scene, from the British
OL,15,     FBhangra movement to the impact of
OL,16,     FUK Garage, hip-hop and electronic
OL,17,     Fmusic. AJD celebrates seven
OL,18,     Finfluential tracks.
